{"search_note":"The clearest positive evidence is institutional design and formalization: IMSS-Bienestar staffing, rules, and coverage; school-funding via parent committees; and rights-based reforms for Indigenous and women’s protection.

The clearest negative evidence is institutional weakening: attacks on INAI, judicial overhaul, militarization, and hostility toward media and protest.

I did not find a strong independent 2024 after-action assessment proving these institutions remained durable after AMLO’s exit. Most positive evidence is structural or official, so durability is inferred rather than demonstrated.","evidence":[{"title":"Reforma en materia de pueblos indígenas y afromexicanos es un acto de justicia social","publisher":"Presidencia de México","date":"2024-02-21","url":"https://amlo.presidente.gob.mx/reforma-en-materia-de-pueblos-indigenas-y-afromexicanos-es-un-acto-de-justicia-social/","summary":"AMLO backed a constitutional reform that recognized Indigenous and Afro-Mexican peoples as subjects of public rights with self-determination, legal personality, and patrimony. This is direct evidence of creating a rights-bearing institution meant to outlast his personal rule.","question_ids":["6B.9","6B.8","6B.3"]},{"title":"IMSS-Bienestar se consolida con egreso, contratación de especialistas y basificación de personal","publisher":"IMSS","date":"2024-02-27","url":"https://www.imss.gob.mx/prensa/archivo/202402/095","summary":"IMSS said 2024 would be the biggest year for graduating and hiring specialists, and that more than 25,000 IMSS-Bienestar workers had been regularized into permanent posts. That is strong evidence of institutionalization through professional staffing rather than personal discretion.","question_ids":["6B.9","6B.4","6B.5"]},{"title":"IMSS-Bienestar opera en 23 entidades para atender a 53.2 millones de mexicanos que no tienen seguridad social","publisher":"IMSS","date":"2024-04-17","url":"https://www.imss.gob.mx/prensa/archivo/202404/170","summary":"IMSS-Bienestar was described as a federally managed public health system with 131,000 workers, 635 hospitals, and 11,913 health centers serving 53.2 million uninsured people. The measured rollout suggests a durable service architecture rather than a one-off political project.","question_ids":["6B.9","6B.4","6B.5"]},{"title":"ACUERDO mediante el cual se establecen las Reglas de Operación del Programa IMSS-Bienestar para el ejercicio fiscal 2024","publisher":"Diario Oficial de la Federación / IMSS","date":"2024","url":"https://sidof.segob.gob.mx/notas/docFuente/5713366","summary":"The 2024 rules of operation define IMSS-Bienestar through specific medical, finance, and administration units and frame it as a constitutional-rights service system. This is strong evidence of formal, rule-based institution building.","question_ids":["6B.9","6B.4","6B.5"]},{"title":"La escuela es nuestra alcanza cobertura del 99 por ciento en planteles de educación básica","publisher":"Presidencia de México","date":"2024-06-26","url":"https://amlo.presidente.gob.mx/la-escuela-es-nuestra-alcanza-cobertura-del-99-por-ciento-en-planteles-de-educacion-basica/","summary":"The school program used direct funding through parent committees, reducing hierarchy and local gatekeeping. That is evidence of a potentially durable education institution that embeds administration in a local participatory structure.","question_ids":["6B.9","6B.8","6B.5","6B.4"]},{"title":"Estrategia nacional de protección para las mujeres y las niñas con un solo objetivo, que todas se sientan libres y sin miedo","publisher":"SEGOB / CONAVIM","date":"2024-07-25","url":"https://www.gob.mx/conavim/prensa/estrategia-nacional-de-proteccion-para-las-mujeres-y-las-ninas-con-un-solo-objetivo-que-todas-se-sientan-libres-y-sin-miedo-segob-371930?idiom=es","summary":"The government framed gender-violence policy as a territorial, capacity-building strategy rather than a symbolic campaign. That supports institution-building in the women’s protection space, though the evidence is still mostly official.","question_ids":["6B.9","6B.8","6B.3"]},{"title":"Se refuerza estrategia contra la violencia hacia las mujeres y niñas: SSPC","publisher":"SSPC","date":"2024-08-06","url":"https://www.gob.mx/sspc/prensa/se-refuerza-estrategia-contra-la-violencia-hacia-las-mujeres-y-ninas-sspc","summary":"SSPC reported outreach, training for public servants and police, and an explicit anti-violence policy architecture. This is another sign of social-institution building, though the headline performance claims remain official.","question_ids":["6B.9","6B.8","6B.3"]},{"title":"Ninguna forma de discriminación racial debe existir","publisher":"SEGOB / CONAPRED","date":"2024-03-21","url":"https://www.gob.mx/segob/prensa/ninguna-forma-de-discriminacion-racial-debe-existir?idiom=en","summary":"The government itself acknowledged racial profiling, arbitrary detentions, invisibility of Afro-Mexicans, and barriers to identity documents for Indigenous, migrant, and ethnic-minority people. This is negative evidence that durable equal-opportunity institutions were still incomplete and uneven.","question_ids":["6B.9","6B.8","6B.3"]},{"title":"HRW: Mexico World Report 2024","publisher":"Human Rights Watch","date":"2024","url":"https://www.hrw.org/es/world-report/2024/country-chapters/mexico","summary":"HRW said AMLO and his party blocked appointments to INAI, leaving the transparency/data-protection body unable to function normally. Weakening a key oversight institution cuts against durability because it reduces the checks that let social institutions survive beyond one ruler.","question_ids":["6B.9","6B.5","6B.7"]},{"title":"Mexico's constitutional reforms more likely with supermajority in sight","publisher":"Reuters via Investing.com","date":"2024-06-04","url":"https://www.investing.com/news/world-news/mexico-constitutional-reforms-more-likely-with-supermajority-in-sight-3469906","summary":"Reuters reported AMLO frequently lambasted the INE and pushed an overhaul critics saw as a way to cement Morena’s political hegemony. That points to personalization and institutional capture risk rather than durable, ruler-independent social institutions.","question_ids":["6B.9","6B.7","6B.5"]},{"title":"Mexico's sweeping judicial overhaul formally takes effect","publisher":"Reuters via Investing.com","date":"2024-09-15","url":"https://www.investing.com/news/world-news/mexicos-sweeping-judicial-overhaul-formally-takes-effect-3616588","summary":"Reuters reported the overhaul weakened judicial independence and investor confidence. Weak courts make it harder for social institutions to outlast personal rule because they become easier to bend or repurpose.","question_ids":["6B.9","6B.7","6B.5"]},{"title":"Mexican senators push through reform to boost military control over security","publisher":"Reuters via Investing.com","date":"2024-09-25","url":"https://www.investing.com/news/world-news/mexican-senators-push-through-reform-to-boost-military-control-over-security-3632396","summary":"The Senate approved a reform giving the armed forces control of the civilian-led National Guard, with critics warning it expanded military power over law and order. That is negative evidence for durable civilian social institutions.","question_ids":["6B.9","6B.7","6B.3"]},{"title":"Digital News Report 2024: Mexico","publisher":"Reuters Institute for the Study of Journalism","date":"2024-06-17","url":"https://reutersinstitute.politics.ox.ac.uk/digital-news-report/2024/mexico","summary":"AMLO’s final year was marked by continued verbal attacks on journalists, human-rights advocates, and the media. A hostile climate toward scrutiny weakens the institutional foundations needed for social systems to survive and self-correct.","question_ids":["6B.9","6B.8","6B.7"]},{"title":"Mexico City police arrest 2 journalists at human rights protest","publisher":"Committee to Protect Journalists","date":"2024-09-09","url":"https://cpj.org/2024/09/mexico-city-police-arrest-2-journalists-at-human-rights-protest/","summary":"Police beat and arrested journalists covering a protest. This is direct evidence against a stable, rights-respecting institutional order that can outlast one leader.","question_ids":["6B.9","6B.8","6B.7"]}]}
